  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- Walking distance to the beach | Approximately 400 Feet<br>- Private pool & Spa (Heating available for an additional $80 per day during the months of Oct 31-May 1)<br>- Outdoor Fireplace + Seating<br>- Lake Front with Lake Access<br>- Summer Kitchen with Grilling Station<br>- Media Room & Game Room with Bar<br>- 6 Adult Bikes Included<br>- 6 seater Golf Cart included<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (Sleeps 28):<br><br>FIRST FLOOR<br>•\tGuest Bedroom: King Bed (sleeps 2) & En-suite Bathroom – Single Vanity & Shower<br>•\tGuest Bedroom: King Bed (sleeps 2) & En-suite Bathroom – Single Vanity & Shower<br>•\tGuest Bedroom: King Bed (sleeps 2) & En-suite Bathroom – Single Vanity & Shower<br>•\tBunk Room: Two Twin over Queen Bunks (sleeps 6)& En-suite Bathroom – Single Vanity & Shower/Tub Combo <br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>•\tGuest Bedroom: King Bed (sleeps 2) & En-suite Bathroom – Single Vanity & Shower<br>•\tGuest Bedroom: King Bed (sleeps 2) & En-suite Bathroom – Single Vanity & Shower<br>•\tPrimary Bedroom: King Bed (sleeps 2) & En-suite bathroom – Double Vanities & Tub inside shower enclosure<br><br>THIRD FLOOR<br>•\tPrimary Bedroom (Family Suite): King Bed (sleeps 2) + Seating area & En-suite Bathroom – Double Vanities, Soaking Tub + Shower<br>•\tBunk Room: Two twin over twins + gaming room (Sleeps 4) & en-suite bath single vanity, shower only<br>•\tGuest Bedroom: King Bed (sleeps 2) & shared bath | single vanity, shower only<br>•\tGuest Bedroom: King Bed (sleeps 2) & shared bath | single vanity, shower only<br><br><br>Outdoor area - fenced<br>•\tPool <br>•\tSpa<br>•\tFirepit with seating area<br>•\tOutdoor Dining<br>•\t7 Loungers + Umbrellas<br>•\tSummer Kitchen 2nd floor – Grilling Station, Sink, Fridge<br><br>Enter a perpetual state of relaxation at ‘Timeless 30A’, an enchanting nine-bedroom vacation retreat nestled in Dune Allen Beach that accommodates up to 28 guests. Just 400 feet away, you will find the gentle waves and sugar-white quartz sand beaches of the Gulf of Mexico. <br><br>The heart of this home is its stunning outdoor oasis, where you can lounge by the pool, listen to the soothing waterfall of the spa, and soak in the sunshine. Experience the joy of family and friends gathering around the first-floor bar area, enjoying friendly billiards competitions. The game room, bar, and media area are thoughtfully situated around three guest suites, each adorned with comfortable textures and neutral tones, featuring a plush king bed and a private ensuite bath complete with an elegant vanity and contemporary tiled glass shower. <br><br>Ascend to the second floor by stairs or elevator and discover the expansive open living space designed for multigenerational gatherings. The gourmet kitchen boasts upscale culinary appliances, a custom island seating seven, and a scullery equipped with a dishwasher, sink, and wine fridge. This remarkable kitchen overlooks the adjacent dining room and welcoming living area, enhanced by golden aquamarine hues, while a generous outdoor porch shelters the summer kitchen and grilling station, perfect for the group's grill master. The second floor also features two additional king guest rooms with ensuite bathrooms and the enchanting primary bedroom, which serves as a sanctuary complete with a king bed, a separate seating area, and a dreamy primary bath showcasing dual vanities and an extraordinary walk-in shower encasing a modern soaking tub. A spacious laundry room with a sink and folding area offers convenient access from the main living area. <br><br>On rainy days, enjoy classic films in the third-floor theater room, which includes a wet bar for snacks and beverages conveniently located behind the plush movie theater seating. This level also houses a second primary bedroom with a luxurious spa-like ensuite bathroom, along with an additional king guest room sharing a bathroom with the theater. The bunk room caters to gaming enthusiasts, featuring a separate seating area and two twin-over-twin bunks behind a pocket door. The Third Floor also has two additional king bedrooms with ensuite baths.<br><br>‘Timeless 30A’ is destined to become a cherished family tradition, fostering the creation of memories that resonate across generations through countless shared activities. Cherish every moment with family and friends at Timeless 30A, where time stands still.<br><br>Restaurants nearby:<br>•\tStinky’s Fish Camp (Casual - Creole Seafood)<br>•\tSons BBQ (Casual)<br>•\tThe Vue (Fine dining - Gulf View)<br>•\tShunk Gulley (Casual – Gulf View)<br>•\tPerfect Pig (Casual - American)<br>•\tLocal Catch (Casual - Seafood)<br>•\tBasmati’s (Casual – Asian)<br>•\tGrower’s Garage (Brewery)<br>•\tPecan Jack’s (Ice Cream & Candy)<br>•\tChef’s 30A Deli (Fine Dining)<br>•\tRenaissance (Fine Dining – French)<br>•\tPizza by the Sea (Casual)<br>•\tSouth of Philly (Casual)<br><br>Convenient Location:<br>•\tWalmart Supercenter 7 Miles via hwy 98 <br>•\tGulf Place (approximately 1 mile) <br>•\tSeaside 7.5 Miles<br>•\tBeach access approximately 400 feet away",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Timeless 30A|Easy Beach Access|Private Pool|Outdoor Fireplace|Directly on Lake"
        }
      ],
