          {
            "date": "Mar 19, 2026",
            "id": "134bcae9-5f39-4803-999e-a716151622a8",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for the wonderful review! We’re so glad the home and amenities worked perfectly for your group and that you enjoyed the quick walk to the beach. We’d love to host you again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Fantastic house with great amenities and an under 5 minute walk to the beach! Perfect for large groups with everyone having their own bedrooms and bathrooms. Would absolutely recommend!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Cynthia C.",
        "date": "2025-11-14T12:47:29Z",
        "id": "691733021d8f412c74599df4",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Nov 18, 2025",
            "id": "9d8e62d7-7ddf-4b15-8a47-baa210251a53",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for sharing such kind feedback! We’re delighted to hear the home worked so well for your family and that our team at ELP made your stay smooth and enjoyable. It means a lot to know you plan to return and we look forward to welcoming you back for many more visits!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Excellent location and home for a large family. The house was beautiful, clean, and spacious for young and old. The professionalism and attentiveness by the staff at ELP was above and beyond anywhere we have stayed in the area. Any questions were answered quickly with kindness and patience, This will be our spot for many years!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Kelly C.",
        "date": "2025-09-03T18:16:25Z",
        "id": "68b894803218fd3afa666a45",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Sep 12, 2025",
            "id": "7f72abe1-3150-41ae-b822-b3fda2502d31",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your kind words! We’re glad to hear you enjoyed the home and amenities, and we’d love to welcome you back anytime.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We really enjoyed our stay. Everyone had their own space and bathroom. Having the additional half baths worked out well too. The golf cart was great to carry stuff to the beach or go grab a bite to eat. Part of our group enjoyed the bikes. We would stay again or recommend it to friends or family.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Jennifer C.",
        "date": "2025-06-06T21:45:43Z",
        "id": "685a6a81ddbb991f5a995b71",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We had the most wonderful stay! The home is absolutely beautiful—peaceful, spacious, and perfectly designed for multiple families to relax and enjoy time together with plenty of privacy. The golf cart made beach access so easy and convenient, and the fully equipped kitchen gave our whole family room to cook and connect. The SubZero frig/freezer and ice machines, multiple dishwashers make life a breeze during our week there. The pool was a favorite spot, especially for our late afternoon swims with the grandkids. Everything about this home made our beach trip extra special—we can’t wait to come back!&#x1fa75;",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Kristina H.",
        "date": "2025-08-17T21:48:38Z",
        "id": "68a25c796aeedf765efc1036",
        "label": "Good",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 8,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Aug 18, 2025",
            "id": "8911342c-3b7d-480a-8957-0972bdeb091f",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your feedback and for sharing your experience with us. I truly apologize for the inconveniences you encountered during your stay. While I’m glad you found the house beautiful, it’s disappointing to hear about the issues with the pool area, hot tub, and third-floor maintenance.\nI regret that the pine straw was not cleared properly and that the blower was not functioning as it should. You should not have had to handle that yourself, and I will be addressing this directly with our team to ensure proper equipment and preparation moving forward. I’m also glad the hot tub was ultimately heated but apologize that it wasn’t ready upon arrival.\nRegarding the mildew above the doors and windows, I sincerely appreciate you bringing this to my attention. I was not aware of this issue, and I will have it inspected and properly remediated right away to prevent any further concerns.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The house was beautiful but the outside around the pool had a ton of pine straw and the hot tub did not get hot. We called and someone came out with a leaf blower that did not work so we had to sweep around the pool. They did get the hot tub heated. The third floor has mold above some of the doors and windows you may want to take care of that.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
